increases with deteriorating glucose tolerance status: the Hoorn Study</article-title>.<source>Circulation</source><year>2003</year>;<volume>107</volume>:<fpage>2089</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>2095</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12695300</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>